  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Nutrition and Social Protection project</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project development objective is to improve Honduras&apos; social safety net for children and youth by: (i) strengthening theGovernment&apos;s capacity to administer social assistance programs; (ii) improving nutritional and health status of young children byexpanding the AIN-C program; and (iii) increasing employability of at-risk youth by piloting a First Employment Program.</narrative>
  </description>
